MODULE: SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE

OBJECTIVE:
Define the full MINERVA system architecture for frontend, backend, mobile deployment, curriculum governance, and agent generation.

LAYERS:
- PresentationLayer
- LessonEngineLayer
- QuestionEngineLayer
- AdaptiveLearningLayer
- GamificationLayer
- AnalyticsLayer
- PersistenceLayer
- MobileOfflineLayer
- AIInstructionLayer

FRONTEND:
- NextJSAppRouter
- ReactComponents
- TypeScriptDomainModels
- TailwindDesignTokens
- FramerMotionAnimations
- CenterAlignedLayoutSystem

BACKEND:
- FirebaseAuth
- Firestore
- FirebaseStorage
- CloudFunctions
- SecurityRules

MOBILE:
- PWAManifest
- ServiceWorker
- OfflineCache
- CapacitorAndroid
- PushNotifications

DATA_DOMAINS:
- UserProfile
- DiagnosticResult
- LessonProgress
- QuestionAttempt
- SkillMastery
- Streaks
- XP
- Badges
- OfficerTrialResults
- AfterActionReviews

NONNEGOTIABLES:
- AFOQTScopeOnly
- CenterAlignedUI
- MobileFirst
- AndroidReady
- PWAReady
- FirebaseReady
